module

public import Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Sites.Sieves.Basic

import StacksCore.Tactic.StacksAttribute

/-!
# Sieves generated by a family of morphisms

Stacks 00Z1 defines the *sieve on `U` generated by a family of morphisms* `{f i : U i ⟶ U}` to be
the smallest sieve containing every `f i`, namely the sieve generated by the corresponding
presieve.

That is Mathlib's `CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows`, which is by definition
`CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate` applied to `CategoryTheory.Presieve.ofArrows`.
-/

@[expose] public section

-- The former @[stacks 00Z1] declaration is now the Mathlib declarations.
add_to_stacks 00Z1 "the family of morphisms `{f i : U i ⟶ U}` as a presieve on `U`"
  CategoryTheory.Presieve.ofArrows
add_to_stacks 00Z1 "the sieve generated by a presieve on `U`" CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate
add_to_sga "3 IV 4.1.1" "special case" CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate
add_to_sga "3 IV 4.2.6" CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate
add_to_sga "4 II 1.4" CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate
add_to_sga "4½ Arcata 1.3.4" "more general" CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate
add_to_sga "4½ Arcata 1.6.1" "generated sieve" CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate
add_to_sga "4½ Arcata 1.4.3" "generated sieve" CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate
add_to_sga "4½ Arcata 1.1" "generated sieve" CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate
add_to_sga "4 I 4.3.3" "generated sieve" CategoryTheory.Sieve.generate
add_to_stacks 00Z1 "the sieve on `U` generated by a family of morphisms `{f i : U i ⟶ U}`, defined
  as the sieve generated by the corresponding presieve" CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows
add_to_sga "3 IV 4.1.1" "special case" CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows
add_to_sga "4 II 1.4" CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows
add_to_sga "4½ Arcata 1.3.4" "more general" CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows
add_to_sga "4½ Arcata 1.6.1" "generated sieve" CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows
add_to_sga "4½ Arcata 1.4.3" "generated sieve" CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows
add_to_sga "4½ Arcata 1.1" "generated sieve" CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows
add_to_sga "4 I 4.3.3" "generated sieve" CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows
